# PACKING: 218 in the chin as a full lattice, 52 as a single centred
# chain up each rail. The rail is 4.15mm and a two-column lattice needs 4.55mm --
# see make_bezel_face.py for the sweep. One column has no parity to alternate.
# >>> 218 of them (81%) sit below y=13.61 and are INSIDE
